    {
      "id": "p0125-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that the term \"battle body\" is a direct reference to Sigma’s \"battle body\" in Mega Man X3. The translator checked the original Japanese version of Mega Man X3, found that it used the term sentōyō bodi (\"body for combat use\"), and then used that term in the Japanese Undertale script.",
        "raw": "Toby noted that the term \"battle body\" is a direct reference to Sigma's \"battle\nbody\" in Mega Man X3. The translator checked the original Japanese version\nof Mega Man X3, found that it used the term sentc5yc5 bodi (\"body for combat\nuse\"), and then used that term in the Japanese Underta/e script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09626344,
          0.65475,
          0.68812988,
          0.7229
        ],
